What this script does fundamentally
It defines a tiny tenant-scoped “copilot” workflow.
DOCUMENT_STORE is a shared in-memory dataset with text entries tagged by tenant_id.
retrieve(tenant_id, query):
filters documents to only those belonging to that tenant
scores them by keyword overlap with the question
returns the top k matching text snippets
tenant_copilot(tenant_id, question):
builds a prompt with the retrieved tenant-specific context
calls chat(...) from openrouter_client
asks the model to answer only from that context or say “I don’t know”
The __main__ block:
asks the same question for two tenants, acme and globex
prints two different grounded answers
